      "translation": {
        "english_text": "People of prosperous Kurinji country, where abundance flows, greetings. I am not the king of this state. I am the leader of the people, the servant of the people. The monarchy of Kurinji country has ended. From now on, people's rule will bloom in full, new life will blossom, new thought will grow. Everyone is one clan! Everyone is one people!! Everyone is a ruler of this land!!!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`குடியாட்சி` is rendered as `people's rule`, preserving the source's contrast with `முடியாட்சி` rather than importing a narrower modern constitutional label."
        ]
      }
